  "prefLabel": "Plc 308.02 Eligibility for Renewal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 308.02 Eligibility for Renewal. A licensee shall be eligible to renew the license held if the licensee has:\n\n(a) Met applicable continuing competence requirements;\n\n(b) Met any other requirements for renewal eligibility established in applicable law; and\n\n(c) Paid any monetary penalties that have been assessed against the licensee by an applicable board.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Plc 300) #13606, eff 5-1-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc300.html"
